{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "diagram_type": "explainer",
  "meta": {
    "title": "缓存未命中时，请求为什么变慢？",
    "id": "mechanism",
    "locale": "zh-CN"
  },
  "answer": {
    "summary": "缓存未命中后，请求要多等**数据库查询和同步写回缓存**两段。",
    "reasons": [
      "命中时，接口读到缓存值就能返回。",
      "未命中时，接口必须先拿到数据库结果。",
      "同步写回位于响应之前，写完缓存才能结束请求。"
    ],
    "scope": "示例采用旁路缓存：GET返回空值后查询PostgreSQL，查询成功后同步SET再响应；无并行、重试或其他缓存层。未实测耗时，具体慢多少由链路测量决定。"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": "timeline",
      "title": "一次未命中，时间花在哪？",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "steps",
          "id": "cache-path-steps",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "get-step",
              "text": "读取缓存",
              "detail": "GET返回空值，接口继续向数据库查询。[](source:get-doc)"
            },
            {
              "id": "query-step",
              "text": "查询PostgreSQL",
              "detail": "等待数据库执行SQL并返回结果。"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-step",
              "text": "同步写回Redis",
              "detail": "SET完成后，接口返回响应。[](source:set-doc)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "diff",
      "title": "命中和未命中，差在哪几步？",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "comparison",
          "id": "cache-comparison",
          "columns": [
            "命中",
            "未命中"
          ],
          "rows": [
            {
              "label": "读Redis",
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "取得值",
                  "assessment": "good",
                  "verdict": "直接返回"
                },
                {
                  "text": "取得空值",
                  "assessment": "caution",
                  "verdict": "继续查询"
                }
              ],
              "id": "row-67fe9814e476"
            },
            {
              "label": "查PostgreSQL",
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "跳过",
                  "assessment": "good",
                  "verdict": "省去查询"
                },
                {
                  "text": "等待结果",
                  "assessment": "caution",
                  "verdict": "增加等待"
                }
              ],
              "id": "row-bb530b3792c8"
            },
            {
              "label": "写回Redis",
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "跳过",
                  "assessment": "good",
                  "verdict": "省去写回"
                },
                {
                  "text": "同步SET",
                  "assessment": "caution",
                  "verdict": "增加等待"
                }
              ],
              "id": "row-cbc9f8528502"
            },
            {
              "label": "响应路径",
              "cells": [
                {
                  "text": "一段读取",
                  "assessment": "good",
                  "verdict": "路径短"
                },
                {
                  "text": "三段顺序等待",
                  "assessment": "caution",
                  "verdict": "路径长"
                }
              ],
              "id": "row-d108c6645625"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "checks",
      "title": "想缩短等待，先查什么？",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "记录`cache=hit`或`cache=miss`，区分请求路径。",
            "分别观察GET、SQL和SET耗时，先处理最慢的一段。",
            "检查SQL索引与执行计划；改为异步写回前，设计写入失败的恢复流程。"
          ],
          "id": "list-7e8599e477aa"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "get-doc",
      "title": "Redis GET：不存在的键返回空值",
      "url": "https://redis.io/docs/latest/commands/get/"
    },
    {
      "id": "set-doc",
      "title": "Redis SET：设置键值",
      "url": "https://redis.io/docs/latest/commands/set/"
    }
  ]
}

